    "recommendedWorkflow": [
      "For sourced images: store both the pageUrl (for attribution) and the direct assetUrl (for retrieval).",
      "Render/export at 2x resolution if resizing/cropping in your pipeline.",
      "Avoid adding baked-in text onto the sourced image itself; overlay text in your layout step."
